{
 "why": {
  "meta": {
   "title": "为什么选择 Pain001：五问商业价值",
   "description": "支付文件被退回的代价、为什么 2026 年 11 月 14 日不可更改、Pain001 如何应对、成本多少（零）、是否安全——每个答案均附证据链接。",
   "eyebrow": "商业价值",
   "deck": "CFO 真正关心的五个问题——用通俗语言作答，每项论断均附证据链接。"
  },
  "text": {
   "<a href=\"/\">Home</a>": "<a href=\"/\">首页</a>",
   "Contents": "目录",
   "<a href=\"#what-does-a-rejected-payment-file-cost\">What does a rejected payment file cost?</a>": "<a href=\"#what-does-a-rejected-payment-file-cost\">支付文件被退回的代价是什么？</a>",
   "<a href=\"#why-is-14-november-2026-non-negotiable\">Why is 14 November 2026 non-negotiable?</a>": "<a href=\"#why-is-14-november-2026-non-negotiable\">为什么 2026 年 11 月 14 日不可更改？</a>",
   "<a href=\"#what-does-pain001-do-about-it\">What does Pain001 do about it?</a>": "<a href=\"#what-does-pain001-do-about-it\">Pain001 如何应对？</a>",
   "<a href=\"#what-does-it-cost\">What does it cost?</a>": "<a href=\"#what-does-it-cost\">它的成本是多少？</a>",
   "<a href=\"#is-it-safe\">Is it safe?</a>": "<a href=\"#is-it-safe\">它安全吗？</a>",
   "<a href=\"#what-is-the-next-step\">What is the next step?</a>": "<a href=\"#what-is-the-next-step\">下一步是什么？</a>",
   "What does a rejected payment file cost?<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#what-does-a-rejected-payment-file-cost\" aria-label=\"Link to section: What does a rejected payment file cost?\">#</a>": "支付文件被退回的代价是什么？<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#what-does-a-rejected-payment-file-cost\" aria-label=\"Link to section: What does a rejected payment file cost?\">#</a>",
   "A file the bank bounces does not fail quietly. Someone diagnoses the reason code, repairs the source data, regenerates, resubmits — and if the repair misses the day's cut-off, settlement slips. For payroll or supplier runs, a slipped day is a phone call you do not want to make. The <a href=\"/pain002-reason-codes/\">reason-code reference</a> lists what banks actually send back; almost every format-class entry on it is preventable before submission.": "被银行退回的文件不会悄然了结。总要有人诊断原因代码、修复源数据、重新生成并重新提交——如果修复错过了当日截止时间，结算就会顺延。对于工资或供应商付款批次而言，延误一天意味着一通您绝不想打的电话。<a href=\"/pain002-reason-codes/\">原因代码参考</a>列出了银行实际返回的内容；其中几乎所有格式类条目都可以在提交前予以避免。",
   "Why is 14 November 2026 non-negotiable?<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#why-is-14-november-2026-non-negotiable\" aria-label=\"Link to section: Why is 14 November 2026 non-negotiable?\">#</a>": "为什么 2026 年 11 月 14 日不可更改？<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#why-is-14-november-2026-non-negotiable\" aria-label=\"Link to section: Why is 14 November 2026 non-negotiable?\">#</a>",
   "Because it is enforced at network level, not by policy. From that date, cross-border payments (CBPR+) carrying fully unstructured postal addresses are rejected, and the interbank MT101 relay retires in favour of <code>pain.001</code> version 9. The dates come from SWIFT, not from us — every one is cited in the <a href=\"/2026-iso20022-migration-trends/\">2026 briefing</a>, and the schedule continues to 2028 on the <a href=\"/iso20022-roadmap/\">living roadmap</a>.": "因为它是在网络层面强制执行的，而非出于政策。自该日起，携带完全非结构化邮政地址的跨境支付（CBPR+）将被拒收，银行间 MT101 中继也将退役，由 <code>pain.001</code> 第 9 版取代。这些日期来自 SWIFT，而非我们——每一项都在<a href=\"/2026-iso20022-migration-trends/\">2026 年简报</a>中注明出处，时间表在<a href=\"/iso20022-roadmap/\">持续更新的路线图</a>上延续至 2028 年。",
   "What does Pain001 do about it?<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#what-does-pain001-do-about-it\" aria-label=\"Link to section: What does Pain001 do about it?\">#</a>": "Pain001 如何应对？<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#what-does-pain001-do-about-it\" aria-label=\"Link to section: What does Pain001 do about it?\">#</a>",
   "Three things. It turns the data you already have — spreadsheets, ERP exports, legacy SWIFT files — into bank-ready ISO 20022 payment files. It proves each file clean before submission: validation against the bank's official rulebook (ISO 20022 XSD), the account-number checksum your bank runs (ISO 13616 mod-97), and control totals recalculated from the records, never trusted. And it does all of this on your own infrastructure — nothing is uploaded anywhere.": "三件事。它将您已有的数据——电子表格、ERP 导出文件、传统 SWIFT 文件——转换为可直接提交银行的 ISO 20022 支付文件。它在提交前证明每个文件均无瑕疵：依据银行的官方规则手册（ISO 20022 XSD）进行校验，执行您的银行所使用的账号校验和（ISO 13616 mod-97），并根据记录重新计算控制总额，绝不盲目采信。而且这一切都在您自己的基础设施上完成——任何数据都不会被上传。",
   "What does it cost?<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#what-does-it-cost\" aria-label=\"Link to section: What does it cost?\">#</a>": "它的成本是多少？<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#what-does-it-cost\" aria-label=\"Link to section: What does it cost?\">#</a>",
   "Nothing, at any scale, permanently. The core is dual-licensed (Apache-2.0 or MIT); companion packages are Apache-2.0. The nearest commercial reference point — SWIFT's translation SDK — is publicly listed at €10,000–30,000 per year before integration effort. The full landscape, including where commercial platforms genuinely win, is in the <a href=\"/competitors-comparison/\">comparison</a>.": "零成本，任何规模，永久如此。核心采用双重许可（Apache-2.0 或 MIT）；配套软件包采用 Apache-2.0。最接近的商业参照——SWIFT 的转换 SDK——公开标价为每年 €10,000–30,000，尚不含集成成本。完整格局，包括商业平台真正胜出之处，见<a href=\"/competitors-comparison/\">对比分析</a>。",
   "Is it safe?<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#is-it-safe\" aria-label=\"Link to section: Is it safe?\">#</a>": "它安全吗？<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#is-it-safe\" aria-label=\"Link to section: Is it safe?\">#</a>",
   "Check rather than trust: payment data <a href=\"/privacy/\">never leaves your machines</a>, the dependency inventory is a published <a href=\"/sbom.cdx.json\">SBOM</a>, the code holds <a href=\"/architecture-and-patents/\">100% branch coverage as a CI gate</a>, and the <a href=\"/try/\">browser demo</a> invites your security team to falsify the claims with DevTools open.": "核验而非轻信：支付数据<a href=\"/privacy/\">绝不离开您的设备</a>，依赖项清单是公开发布的 <a href=\"/sbom.cdx.json\">SBOM</a>，代码以 <a href=\"/architecture-and-patents/\">100% 分支覆盖率作为 CI 门槛</a>，<a href=\"/try/\">浏览器演示</a>更欢迎您的安全团队打开 DevTools 来证伪这些论断。",
   "What is the next step?<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#what-is-the-next-step\" aria-label=\"Link to section: What is the next step?\">#</a>": "下一步是什么？<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#what-is-the-next-step\" aria-label=\"Link to section: What is the next step?\">#</a>",
   "Watch it work: the <a href=\"/try/\">60-second demo</a> validates a payment batch and proves it against the official schema, in your browser. Then hand your team the <a href=\"/executive-brief/\">executive brief</a> — one page, print-ready, available in <a href=\"/fr/executive-brief/\">French</a>, <a href=\"/de/executive-brief/\">German</a>, and <a href=\"/es/executive-brief/\">Spanish</a>.": "眼见为实：<a href=\"/try/\">60 秒演示</a>在您的浏览器中校验一个支付批次，并依据官方模式加以证明。然后把<a href=\"/executive-brief/\">高管简报</a>交给您的团队——仅一页，可直接打印，另有<a href=\"/fr/executive-brief/\">法文</a>、<a href=\"/de/executive-brief/\">德文</a>和<a href=\"/es/executive-brief/\">西班牙文</a>版本。"
  },
